//   - sends a 6-digit code over WhatsApp and checks it
//   - the code is never stored, only a hash of it
//   - 10 minutes to use it, 5 wrong tries, 3 codes per 15 minutes
//   - one new endpoint the storefront can call: /apps/track/otp

